 "answer_verbatim": "**PriceLabs is the best all-in-one choice** if you want both to set nightly rates and research a property before buying. Its Dynamic Pricing adjusts rates based on factors such as seasonality, demand, events, and booking pace; its Market Dashboards show local metrics such as occupancy, average daily rate, revenue, and booking trends.\n\nIf your main priority is **investment research across markets**, compare it with **AirDNA**, which offers market-level data and revenue estimates. Either tool’s projections are estimates—not guarantees—so check local regulations, expenses, and comparable listings before buying.",
